OL,3,GNEWSA22-year-old arrested over
OL,4,Ahit-and-run
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been arrested following a
OL,7,Fhit-and-run in Renfrewshire.
OL,9,FPolice were called at about 09:10 on
OL,10,FSaturday following the incident on Lawn
OL,11,FStreet in Paisley.
OL,13,FA 74-year-old man and a 47-year-old
OL,14,Fwoman were taken to hospital for
OL,15,Ftreatment.
OL,17,FA Police Scotland spokesperson said:
OL,18,F"The 22-year-old male driver of the car
OL,19,Fwhich left the scene was traced by
OL,20,Fpolice a short time later and he was
OL,21,Farrested in connection."
